{{define "main"}}
<section class="px-gutter py-12 md:py-16">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <div class="mb-6 rounded-xl border-2 border-amber-500 bg-amber-50 p-5 text-amber-950" role="alert">
            <p class="font-label text-label-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Draft — not approved for publication</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-body-sm">This placeholder is not a complete privacy policy and is not legal advice. Have qualified counsel and the site owner complete and approve it before relying on it or treating it as final.</p>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-headline text-4xl text-on-background md:text-display-md">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Draft for the Tabiri Analytics website. Effective date and responsible legal entity: <strong>[confirm and complete]</strong>.</p>

        <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">Information collected</h2>
                <p class="mt-3">Website forms may collect information you submit, such as your name, email address, organization, and details about your inquiry or newsletter subscription. The site also uses Cloudflare Turnstile to help protect forms from automated abuse. Google Tag Manager and analytics tags are loaded only after you accept analytics in the cookie preferences.</p>
                <p class="mt-3"><strong>For review:</strong> identify every data element, source, purpose, and whether any analytics tags collect personal data.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">How information is used and shared</h2>
                <p class="mt-3"><strong>For review:</strong> document each purpose and legal basis where applicable; name service providers and other recipients, including form-protection and analytics providers; explain international transfers if any.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">Retention and security</h2>
                <p class="mt-3"><strong>For review:</strong> specify retention periods or criteria for each information type, deletion practices, and the safeguards actually used.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">Cookies and choices</h2>
                <p class="mt-3">You can accept or reject analytics, and reopen Cookie settings from the site footer to change your choice. <strong>For review:</strong> identify cookies and similar technologies used by the site and its providers, their purposes and durations, and any jurisdiction-specific choices or rights.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm text-on-background">Your rights and contact</h2>
                <p class="mt-3"><strong>For review:</strong> explain applicable privacy rights, how to exercise them, any appeal process, and the correct privacy contact details. Until finalized, you may use the <a class="text-primary underline" href="/contact">contact form</a> to reach Tabiri Analytics.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </article>
</section>
{{end}}
